		(property "Notes" "Bidirectional TVS, starts at ~26.7 V either way: clamps positive surges below the TMC2209's 29 V and the XL1509's 40 V, negative spikes before they reach Q1 (40 V), and rail spikes coming back through Q1 while it is on. A reversed 24 V adapter stays below its breakdown. Replaces v0.1.0's SMBJ33CA (D1) and SMBJ24A (D3). The adapter must stay below ~26 V"
			(at 91.44 52.07 0)
			(hide yes)
