					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
		(property "Notes" "Hongfa DPDT, single side stable, 24 V standard coil, contacts 3 A at 40 VDC (UL). Same pins as the Omron G5V-2 (1/16 coil, + on 1; 4/13 common, 6/11 NC unused, 8/9 NO), 20.2 x 10.2 x 10.6 mm. Breaks A1 and B1. Hongfa recommends 1.0 mm holes; the G5V-2 footprint has 0.7 mm, so widen them at layout"
			(at 529.59 59.69 0)
			(hide yes)
