				)
			)
		)
		(property "Notes" "Honeywell Hall latch, open collector, sensor A. Back side at the left edge, branded face towards the gear. Pins 1 Vs, 2 GND, 3 OUT. Straight-lead SS460S: 1.27 mm pitch, 0.38 mm leads widening to 0.56 mm max near the body; Honeywell asks for holes of at least 0.68 mm (TO-92S has 0.75 mm). The -T2 version has formed leads at 2.54 mm"
			(at 149.86 207.01 0)
